Error [jet.UnknownContextField]: Context key `counter` can't be mutable
  --> tests/ui/context_key_mutable.jet:2:13
    |
  2 | #ContextKey counter := 0
    |             ^^^^^^^
 Why: A key's value is its fixed default; a `#Context` block sets it for its body
 Fix: Declare it with `:` and set it with `#Context(counter: …)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0761
